{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ResilientPaywallService"}],"title":"ResilientPaywallService","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:13SwiduxPaywall09ResilientB7ServiceV","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxPaywall"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ResilientPaywallService"}],"roleHeading":"Structure"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall"]]},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/init(base:store:maxAttempts:seedsFromCache:maxCacheAge:retryBaseDelay:now:)"]},{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/currentSnapshot()","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/customerInfo()","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/customerInfoStream()","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/restorePurchases()"]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ResilientPaywallService"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallPlugin","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" populates "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallState","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — and therefore the feature gate,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"account display, and whether the paywall sheet is shown — entirely from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"snapshots its wrapped service emits. A slow, silent, or throwing entitlement"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"read at cold launch leaves that state at its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"free"},{"type":"text","text":" default. This decorator"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps a persisted last-known-good so the gate never collapses to free on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transient failure, while the server remains the authoritative gate: a later"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"live snapshot always overwrites the cache, so a genuine lapse is honoured."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The cache is bounded by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxCacheAge"},{"type":"text","text":" (72 hours by default): a stale cache"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stops vouching for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isPro"},{"type":"text","text":" — subscriptions lapse, and an install that stays"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"offline past the bound must not keep pro forever — but keeps"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasPermanentLicense"},{"type":"text","text":", because lifetime purchases don’t expire."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Provider-agnostic by construction — it speaks only "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", so it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wraps any base (simulated, RevenueCat, StoreKit, …). Feed the wrapped instance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"both"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallPlugin","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and any app-side reader that builds a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"monetization\/context payload from entitlements."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Back the cache with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyValueStore"},{"type":"text","text":" rather than "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UserDefaults"},{"type":"text","text":": the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cache vouches for a paid entitlement offline, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UserDefaults"},{"type":"text","text":" is a plist"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a user can edit or restore from a doctored backup, whereas the Keychain is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"encrypted and not plist-editable. (On unsigned macOS dev builds the Keychain"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can return "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"errSecMissingEntitlement"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ −34018 — see "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sandboxing &"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entitlements (macOS)"}]},{"type":"text","text":" on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyValueStore"},{"type":"text","text":".)"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let resilient = ResilientPaywallService(","    base: paywallService,","    store: KeychainKeyValueStore(service: \"com.example.myapp\")",")","\/\/ PaywallPlugin(..., service: resilient)   \/\/ gate + account display","\/\/ await resilient.currentSnapshot()        \/\/ server payload, off-main"],"type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Threat-model","level":2,"text":"Threat model","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Backed by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyValueStore"},{"type":"text","text":", the cache defends against casual plist"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"editing and a doctored-backup restore: the persisted last-known-good is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"encrypted and not a user-editable file. It does "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}]},{"type":"text","text":" defend against a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"jailbroken device — nothing client-side does; entitlements can always be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"forged on a device the attacker fully controls. The live provider stays"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"authoritative whenever the app is online: any live snapshot overwrites the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cache, so a genuine lapse or downgrade is honoured on the next successful"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"read. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasPermanentLicense"},{"type":"text","text":" deliberately never expires — a lifetime purchase"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"must keep working offline indefinitely."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Wraps a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" so a transient failure to read entitlements never","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"presents a previously-seen paid user as free.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/currentSnapshot()":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/currentSnapshot()","title":"currentSnapshot()","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/currentsnapshot()","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Non-throwing read for callers that always want a snapshot, degrading to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"free only for a genuinely-unknown user. Convenient for building a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"per-request monetization context off the main actor.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"currentSnapshot"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall19EntitlementSnapshotV","text":"EntitlementSnapshot"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"title":"Swift.SendableMetatype","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/s16SendableMetatypeP"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/init(base:store:maxAttempts:seedsFromCache:maxCacheAge:retryBaseDelay:now:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/init(base:store:maxAttempts:seedsFromCache:maxCacheAge:retryBaseDelay:now:)","title":"init(base:store:maxAttempts:seedsFromCache:maxCacheAge:retryBaseDelay:now:)","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/init(base:store:maxattempts:seedsfromcache:maxcacheage:retrybasedelay:now:)","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a resilient decorator around "},{"code":"base","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", persisting last-known-good","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"through ","type":"text"},{"code":"store","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"base"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall0B7ServiceP","text":"PaywallService"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"store"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux13KeyValueStoreP","text":"KeyValueStore"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"maxAttempts"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"seedsFromCache"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"maxCacheAge"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8DurationV","text":"Duration"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"retryBaseDelay"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8DurationV","text":"Duration"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"now"},{"kind":"text","text":": () -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DateV","text":"Date"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/restorePurchases()":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/restorePurchases()","title":"restorePurchases()","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/restorepurchases()","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Restores previously completed purchases, forwarding to the base service.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Persists on success; rethrows on failure (a restore is an explicit user","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"action, so the plugin keeps the prior state).","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"restorePurchases"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntitlementSnapshot","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall19EntitlementSnapshotV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/PaywallState":{"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/paywallstate","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Current paywall state — entitlement status, sheet presentation, and async progress."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PaywallState"}],"title":"PaywallState","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallState","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PaywallState"}]},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/customerInfo()":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/customerInfo()","title":"customerInfo()","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/customerinfo()","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Fetches the current entitlement status, retrying up to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxAttempts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with exponential backoff. On success persists and returns; if every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attempt fails, returns the cached last-known-good when present and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"usable, otherwise rethrows (so the plugin’s honest "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".refreshFailed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"path is preserved for a genuinely-unknown user). Cancellation stops"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"retrying immediately and falls through to the cache."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"customerInfo"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall19EntitlementSnapshotV","text":"EntitlementSnapshot"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall":{"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"SwiduxPaywall","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService":{"title":"ResilientPaywallService","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Wraps a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" so a transient failure to read entitlements never"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presents a previously-seen paid user as free."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ResilientPaywallService","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ResilientPaywallService","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/customerInfoStream()":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/customerInfoStream()","title":"customerInfoStream()","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/customerinfostream()","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Long-lived stream of entitlement updates. Yields the persisted","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"last-known-good first (when ","type":"text"},{"code":"seedsFromCache","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is on and the cache is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"still usable), then forwards and persists every snapshot the base","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stream emits.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"customerInfoStream","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncStream","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntitlementSnapshot","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall19EntitlementSnapshotV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/s8SendableP":{"title":"Swift.Sendable","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/s8SendableP"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/PaywallPlugin":{"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/paywallplugin","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A Swidux plugin that manages paywall state and entitlement checking."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PaywallPlugin","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"PaywallPlugin","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallPlugin","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"PaywallPlugin","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/PaywallService":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PaywallService"}],"title":"PaywallService","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/paywallservice","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","t